 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Nice that you thinking ahead. Would you like start by buying fresh bedding and a few little accessories, or would you rather make small change?water is the big one, keeping it full and refilling the glasses is a great way to stay hydrated. Snacks are lovely, but a few small cups and some clean tea bags are classic hits. A note is lovely, especially if you include a few words about why you like having them stay with you. You could also hide it somewhere they'll find, like under a pillow. A few fresh ones in a vase would look lovely, and they' love having the room brighter.",
